３ ２ １ Go Fight
Three, two, one, go fight!

508
00:26:37,279 --> 00:26:39,279
うっぴーうっぴーはにー ３ ２ １
Yippee, yippee, honey, three, two, one!

509
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:40,579
Fight!

510
00:26:40,579 --> 00:26:43,579
ずきゅんどきゅん 走り出し (ふっふー)
Bang, bang, dashing off! (Woo-hoo!)

511
